    "title": "Golden",
    "description": "The one specification the generator is tested against: TestCodegen_TestData generates pkg/golden from it and interactions.json, which must give the files there, and TestCodegen_Golden builds them and runs their tests, those written by hand among them. Edit them by hand.",
